          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 135959,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni arkadaş ayrıntılarını almak ve bunları yaşlarıyla eklemek için birden fazla işlemi yürütmek üzere bir işlem ifadesi kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;better-sqlite3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" db = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database(\" /><text value=\"&quot;database.db&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"db.exec(\" /><text value=\"`CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS friends (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name TEXT,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  age INTEGER\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" insertFriendWithAge = db.prepare(\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot;INSERT INTO friends (name, age) VALUES (?, ?)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" newFriendsWithAges = [\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Janice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gunther&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"38\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" insertTransactionWithAge = db.transaction(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"friends\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friend \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    insertFriendWithAge.run(friend.name, friend.age);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  insertTransactionWithAge(newFriendsWithAges);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"catch\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (error) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".error(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Transaction failed:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", error.message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rows = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM friends&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\").all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(rows);\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"461\" endIndex=\"472\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 1, name: 'Janice', age: 35 },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 2, name: 'Gunther', age: 38 },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 3, name: 'Mike', age: 40 }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>transaction</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 135960,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdakilerden hangisi işlemler hakkında doğrudur?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tüm sorguları tek bir işlem olarak başarılı olmasını veya başarısız olmasını sağlamak için gruplandırırlar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca ilk ve son sorguları çalıştırırlar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ekleme işlemleri içeremezler</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Tüm sorguların her zaman başarılı olacağını garanti ederler</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tüm sorguları tek bir işlem olarak başarılı olmasını veya başarısız olmasını sağlamak için gruplandırırlar.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir işlem dört müzisyen ekliyor, ancak üçüncü ekleme başarısız oluyor. Bu işlem sonucunda veritabanında ne bulunmalıdır?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hiçbir ekleme bulunmamalıdır, çünkü işlem geri alınır.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca ilk iki ekleme.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca başarısız ekleme atlanır.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Dört eklemenin tümü, çünkü işlemler başarıyı garanti eder.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hiçbir ekleme bulunmamalıdır, çünkü işlem geri alınır.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132527,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodu tamamla; böylece <code>\"Tom\"</code> değerini pets tablosuna ilk değer olarak ekleyelim.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database = \" /><text value=\"require\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;better-sqlite3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" db = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Database(\" /><text value=\"&quot;./database.db&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"db.exec(\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" CREATE TABLE pets (name TEXT, species TEXT)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"db.exec(\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" INSERT INTO pets (name, species)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" VALUES (&quot;Tom&quot;, &quot;Cat&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"147\" endIndex=\"154\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>db.exec</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6 - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132529,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dinamik bir <code>SELECT</code> ifadesi hazırla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getUserByIdQuery = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM pets WHERE id = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = getUserByIdQuery.get(\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pet);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{ id: 50, name: &quot;Bugs&quot;, species: &quot;Bunny&quot; }\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>?</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132528,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>colors tablosundaki tüm kayıtları almak için bir sorgu hazırla ve çalıştır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getColorsQuery = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM colors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users = getColorsQuery.all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(users);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".get()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 1, color: &quot;red&quot; },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 2, color: &quot;green&quot; },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 3, color: &quot;blue&quot; }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>getColorsQuery</code>, ardından <code>db</code> ve sonra <code>.</code>, <code>prepare</code>, <code>getColorsQuery</code>, <code>.all()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hazırlanmış sorguyu <code>getColorsQuery</code> olarak sakla, ardından <code>users</code>, <code>colors</code> tablosundaki her satırı içerecek şekilde çalıştır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getColorsQuery = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM colors&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users = getColorsQuery.all();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(users);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".get()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"exec\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"colors\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 1, color: &quot;red&quot; },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 2, color: &quot;green&quot; },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  { id: 3, color: &quot;blue&quot; }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>getColorsQuery</code>, ardından <code>db</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>prepare</code>, <code>getColorsQuery</code> ve son olarak <code>.all()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 132533,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>pets tablosunda <code>999</code> kimliğine sahip bir kayıt yoksa <code>pet</code> hangi değeri taşıyacak?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getUserByIdQuery = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM pets WHERE id = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = getUserByIdQuery.get(\" /><text value=\"999\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pet);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"undefined\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>undefined</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>null</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>{ }</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>undefined</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sorgu <code>999</code> id'li evcil hayvanı istiyor, ancak hiçbir satır eşleşmiyor. Hangi sonuç <code>get()</code> ile <code>all()</code> arasındaki farkı doğru açıklar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getUserByIdQuery = db.prepare(\" /><text value=\"&quot;SELECT * FROM pets WHERE id = ?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = getUserByIdQuery.get(\" /><text value=\"999\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pet);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"undefined\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>get()</code>, <code>undefined</code> döndürür; <code>all()</code> ise boş bir dizi döndürürdü</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Her iki metot da <code>null</code> döndürür</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>get()</code> boş bir nesne, <code>all()</code> ise <code>undefined</code> döndürür</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>999</code> id'si olmadığı için iki metot da hata verir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>get()</code>, <code>undefined</code> döndürür; <code>all()</code> ise boş bir dizi döndürürdü.</p></body></html>"
          },
